  //- Container with Commenting and Heat Map info & images
  .container
    //- Triple Value Prop
    .row.justify-content-center
      .col--value-prop.col-md-6.col-lg-4
        h2
          | The Fastest Way to
          br
          b Get Students Reading
        img(src="/assets/images/promo/value-prop__fastest.png")
        p Turn any content into a lesson, accessed with a simple code
      .col--value-prop.col-md-6.col-lg-4
        h2
          | The Easiest Way to
          br
          b Annotate Content
        img(src="/assets/images/promo/value-prop__annotate.png")
        p Students highlight and discuss using Emoji, Text or Audio comments
      .col--value-prop.col-md-6.col-lg-4
        h2
          | The Best Way to
          br
          b See Student Thoughts
        img(src="/assets/images/promo/value-prop__thoughts.png")
        p Live updating comments show you every student thought as its shared
    //- Partner badges
    edji-badge-row
    //- Intro video
    .row.promo-row.jumbotron--guide-video
      .col-md-8.mt-4.nopadding.text-center
        .promo-video-thumb((click)="showPromoVideoModal = true")
          .icon.icon-play
          img(src="/assets/images/thumbnail-literacy-is-essential--lg.png")
      .col-md-4.my-4(style="min-height:120px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px;")
        .col__center-content.guide-video-heading
          p.h1.mb-0 Learn how Edji gives teachers powerful, real-time insights
    .row.promo-row.promo-row__no-btm-padding
      .col-md-6
        .col__center-fix
          .promo-text
            h1 Highlight and React
            p Edji readings revolve around your students interacting with text through comments. As they read, students highlight
              | interesting or important parts of the text and leave a comment to express their thoughts about it.
            p Comments can be written with text or strings of Emoji that convey complex thoughts. You can see all comments being
              |made in real time to keep an eye on what your students are thinking.
      .col-md-6.center.nopadding__min-screen
        .row.has-sparks.full-width__min-screen
          .flexi-img.img-fluid.promo-img__background.promo-img-1
    .row.promo-row
      .col-md-6.push-md-6
        .col__center-fix
          .promo-text
            h1 Pinpoint with Heat Map
            p Edji lets you stay on top of how your students are reacting in Edji by watching the Heat Map: A real time,
              | interactive view, that shows you where each highlight is made. When Highlights overlap, the highlights
              | begin to glow.
            p A word with one comment is yellow, but a word with 15 comments glows dark red; making it easy to see
              | what your students care most about in a reading.
      .col-md-6.pull-md-6.center.nopadding__min-screen
        .row.has-sparks.full-width__min-screen
          .flexi-img.img-fluid.promo-img__background.promo-img-2
  //- .container
  //- Sign-up button large and stand-alone
  .row.navy.has-sparks
    .sparks
    .col-sm-12
      .call-to-action
        h1 Share instantly. Read together. Learn loud
        .row
          .col-md-3
          .col-md-3
            .text-center.mb-2
              button.btn.btn-secondary([routerLink]="['/about']", fragment="top") Meet the Team
          .col-md-3
            .text-center
              button.btn.btn-primary([routerLink]="['/register']", fragment="top") Get Started
  //- Tweet Row
  div.mt-4([class.hide]="!tweetsLoaded")
    .container
      .row.promo-row
        .col-12
          h1 What teachers are saying about Edji!
          div(style="border:1px solid #eee; padding: 5px; border-radius:5px;")
            ng4-twitter-timeline([dataSrc]="{sourceType: 'collection', id: '947890483635851267'}", [opts]="{tweetLimit: 10, chrome: { noheader: true }}")
  //- Row below promo
  .container
    //- we don't want this content to be fluid, so we give it another container
    .row.promo-row.promo-row__no-btm-padding
      .col-md-6
        .col__center-fix
          .promo-text
            h1 Go Hero!
            p Edji Hero is the way to take Edji to the next level. As a Hero, you can make unlimited Edji Readings, and can revisit them at any time. You also get full access to the Edji Reading Recap, a tool that breaks down each of your students' engagement, and lets you give live feedback to your students while they read.
            button.btn.btn-hero([routerLink]="['/plans']", fragment="top") Learn More
      .col-md-6.center.nopadding__min-screen
        .row.has-sparks.full-width__min-screen
          .flexi-img.img-fluid.promo-img__background.promo-img-3
    .row.promo-row
      .col-md-6.push-md-6
        .col__center-fix
          .promo-text
            h1 Hassle Free lessons
            p Edji lets you craft engaging lessons based on the individual need of your class. If you find text from articles and
              | journals that reflect your next lesson, you can place it right into an Edji Reading.
            p You can also insert images, gifs, and PDFs to bring your lessons to life. Lessons you create can be shared
              | with others. You can also use the lessons other teachers create from the Discover Feed.
      .col-md-6.pull-md-6.center.nopadding__min-screen
        .row.has-sparks.full-width__min-screen
          .flexi-img.img-fluid.promo-img__background.promo-img-4
  //-  Another Sign-up button large and stand-alone
  .row.navy.has-sparks
    .sparks
    .col-sm-12
      .call-to-action
        h1 Want to see a reading on Edji?
        .btn-row
          button.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg([routerLink]="['/project','demo']") View Demo
    //- A catchy d3m0 reading button

edji-reset-pass(*ngIf="showPassModal", (closeModal)="showPassModal = !showPassModal")
//- Homepage video pop-up
.modal.show(*ngIf="showPromoVideoModal", (click)="showPromoVideoModal = false")
  .modal-dialog.modal-video
    button.close(aria-label="close", (click)="showPromoVideoModal = false")
      span &times;
    .modal-content
      .modal-body
        .embed-responsive.embed-responsive-16by9
          iframe.embed-responsive-item(
              src="//www.youtube.com/embed/F9LgNtwnsZw?autoplay=1",
              frameborder="0",
              allow="autoplay; encrypted-media",
              allowfullscreen
          )
